Research Into New Therapeutic Indications
Clinical research into additional neurological and psychiatric applications may create longer-term opportunities for DBS technology. Collaboration among medical-device companies, academic institutions, and specialist hospitals can support evidence generation, refine treatment approaches, and clarify which patient populations may benefit.

