Regional Market Insights
North America
North America represents a leading market for DBS devices, supported by advanced healthcare infrastructure, established neurosurgical centers, and access to specialized neurological care. The United States is an important market due to the presence of major device manufacturers, ongoing research, and established clinical use for movement disorders. Reimbursement policies and high treatment costs remain important considerations.

Europe
Europe is a significant market, supported by established healthcare systems, neurological research, and specialist treatment centers. Germany, France, the United Kingdom, and Italy contribute to regional demand. Differences in reimbursement arrangements, healthcare budgets, and access to specialist services influence adoption across individual countries.

Asia-Pacific
